        "descriptions": [{"lang": "en", "value": "Remote code execution vulnerability in Apache Log4j2 due to JNDI lookup injection in log messages. Attackers can craft malicious input that triggers JNDI lookups to attacker-controlled servers, resulting in arbitrary code execution on the logging host."}],
